<Base active="Research" title="Research — Vesuliria"><section class="page-hero container"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Research</div><h1 class="section-title">Questions first.<br/>Assumptions second.</h1><p class="lead muted">Research is how we make uncertain ideas testable and turn intriguing possibilities into informed decisions.</p></section><section class="dark-section section"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">How we explore</div><h2 class="section-title">Evidence over<br/>excitement.</h2><div class="process"><article><span class="eyebrow">01 / Observe</span><strong>Find the question.</strong><p>Start with a concrete problem, understand its constraints, and avoid solving the wrong thing.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">02 / Experiment</span><strong>Test the idea.</strong><p>Build focused prototypes and measure what changes, what works, and what doesn't.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">03 / Learn</span><strong>Keep what matters.</strong><p>Document the findings, challenge conclusions, and decide what deserves to move forward.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section container"><div class="eyebrow">Research notes</div><h2 class="section-title">A growing notebook.</h2><p class="lead muted">We plan to share technical notes, experiments and research perspectives here. Published material will be grounded in actual work.</p><a class="arrow-link" href="/contact">Discuss an idea ↗</a></section></Base>